<title>FINLAND: FINNISH APRIL GDP RISES 8 PERCENT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH APRIL GDP RISES 8 PERCENT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic</p>
<p>product (GDP) rose 8 percent year-on-year in April,</p>
<p>Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.5 percent in</p>
<p>April on March, SF said.</p>
<p>			 April 1997     March 1997    April 1996</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +8.0 pct	+5.9 pct	+0.7 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		+0.5 pct	+0.4 pct	+0.2 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
